  "subject": "After her desk neighbour resigned, a woman keeps watering the small cactus he left behind every Friday and leaves him progress notes in his old tray, hoping he will come back to collect it",
  "caption": "Cantonese ukulele and glockenspiel chamber-folk. Strummed ukulele with soft downstrokes carrying the rhythm, glockenspiel doubling the melody lightly, upright bass, brushed cajon, soft accordion pad in the bridge. Warm close-mic home-studio sound with small room air. Female light clear voice, gently sung with steady pitch. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 104 BPM, C major. Gentle, wry, hopeful mood. No rap, no autotune, no electronic drums, no heavy bass, no distorted guitar.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n你辭職嗰日 帶走個紙箱\n留低盆仙人球喺我隔籬\n你話唔使理 佢冇事嘅\n但係我星期五都澆水\n[Pre-Chorus]\n一湯匙水 唔多唔少\n我睇住佢 又高咗少少\n[Chorus]\n星期五澆水 星期五寫紙條\n寫佢今個禮拜點樣\n紙條放喺你舊文件盤\n你路過就睇到\n[Verse]\n第一個月 佢冇乜變\n第二個月 長咗粒細刺\n我寫紙條話 佢冇掛住你\n但係我有啲掛住你\n[Pre-Chorus]\n新同事坐喺你張櫈\n問我點解成日同仙人球講嘢\n[Chorus]\n星期五澆水 星期五寫紙條\n寫佢今個禮拜出咗芽\n紙條放喺你舊文件盤\n三月冇人拎走\n[Verse]\n今朝返嚟 紙條唔見咗\n文件盤入面 有張新嘅\n你嘅字 寫住好多謝\n仲有下星期五 幾點\n[Bridge]\n我拆開張紙條 手有啲慌\n字好細 但係我睇得清\n[Chorus]\n星期五澆水 星期五等你\n你話你都有睇我寫嘅字\n我哋傾咗一個鐘 喺茶水間\n仙人球喺度偷聽\n[Outro]\n星期五 星期五\n下個星期五",
